Changes made in this fork include, but are not limited to:
- LimbusCompany-style lyric overlay replacing the original subtitle panel.
- Bilingual SRT sidecars (main + translation) with independent positions.
- Independent per-cue lyric lines with independent fade-out.
- In-game language switch and settings panel.
- Audio visualizer with a time-driven gradient.
- Text normalization and diagnostic logging.

